    "_postman_id": "4a2c7b4c-b1de-46b0-b806-fe257496ec29",
    "name": "Route Academy - Route Posts API",
    "description": "<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/6eea5c8b-f51d-4b1c-8acd-b8799d80944e/cm91dGUucG5n\" alt=\"Route%20Academy%20Logo\" height=\"284\" width=\"270\">\n\n## About Route Academy\n\nRoute Academy is Egypt's leading Information Technology training center, established in 2012. We specialize in delivering high-quality training in programming, web development, and app development.\n\nThis collection includes all API endpoints for Route Posts with ready-to-run examples.\n\n## Standard Response Shape\n\nAll endpoints return a unified format:\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"...\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"meta\": {}\n}\n\n ```\n\nError format:\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"...\",\n  \"errors\": \"...\"\n}\n\n ```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54167459",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/54167459-4a2c7b4c-b1de-46b0-b806-fe257496ec29?source=collection_link"
